</li>
<li data-start="505" data-end="514" data-section-id="1e9ggzj">
<p data-start="507" data-end="514">キャッチコピー</p>
</li>
<li data-start="515" data-end="528" data-section-id="14pz2cw">
<p data-start="517" data-end="528">「無料体験受付中」など</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="530" data-end="533">
<h2 data-start="535" data-end="542" data-section-id="civq0a">教室紹介</h2>
<ul data-start="543" data-end="576">
<li data-start="543" data-end="553" data-section-id="4b6bhy">
<p data-start="545" data-end="553">どんなレッスンか</p>
</li>
<li data-start="554" data-end="566" data-section-id="7g3qzi">
<p data-start="556" data-end="566">子供向けか大人向けか</p>
</li>
<li data-start="567" data-end="576" data-section-id="oz2jjh">
<p data-start="569" data-end="576">初心者歓迎など</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="578" data-end="581">
<h2 data-start="583" data-end="590" data-section-id="6f2dsw">先生紹介</h2>
