<p data-start="605" data-end="610">好きな音楽</p>
</li>
<li data-start="611" data-end="615" data-section-id="yhvbym">
<p data-start="613" data-end="615">写真</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="617" data-end="657">ここはかなり重要です。<br data-start="628" data-end="631">
個人教室は「先生の雰囲気」で選ばれることが多いです。</p>
<hr data-start="659" data-end="662">
<h2 data-start="664" data-end="673" data-section-id="ydz020">レッスン料金</h2>
<p data-start="674" data-end="676">例：</p>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="678" data-end="736" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="678" data-end="690"><tr data-start="678" data-end="690"><th data-start="678" data-end="684" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">コース</th><th data-start="684" data-end="690" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">月額</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="701" data-end="736"><tr data-start="701" data-end="718"><td data-start="701" data-end="709" data-col-size="sm">子供30分</td><td data-start="709" data-end="718" data-col-size="sm">7000円</td></tr><tr data-start="719" data-end="736"><td data-start="719" data-end="727" data-col-size="sm">大人45分</td><td data-start="727" data-end="736" data-col-size="sm">9000円</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="表をコピーする" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
