<hr data-start="778" data-end="781">
<h2 data-start="783" data-end="795" data-section-id="jggctu">問い合わせフォーム</h2>
<p data-start="796" data-end="800">最低限：</p>
<ul data-start="801" data-end="830">
<li data-start="801" data-end="805" data-section-id="yhvxu0">
<p data-start="803" data-end="805">名前</p>
</li>
<li data-start="806" data-end="811" data-section-id="1ft9em">
<p data-start="808" data-end="811">メール</p>
</li>
<li data-start="812" data-end="820" data-section-id="1q0oo7r">
<p data-start="814" data-end="820">電話（任意）</p>
</li>
<li data-start="821" data-end="830" data-section-id="fjq58j">
<p data-start="823" data-end="830">問い合わせ内容</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="832" data-end="854">WixやSTUDIOなら簡単に追加できます。</p>
<hr data-start="856" data-end="859">
<h1 data-start="861" data-end="880" data-section-id="1dxdxuu">② 少し本格的：WordPress</h1>
<p data-start="882" data-end="907">将来的にブログやお知らせを更新したいなら強いです。</p>
<p data-start="909" data-end="915">必要なもの：</p>
<ul data-start="916" data-end="943">
<li data-start="916" data-end="922" data-section-id="1blx2jx">
<p data-start="918" data-end="922">サーバー</p>
</li>
<li data-start="923" data-end="929" data-section-id="1bhyeuv">
<p data-start="925" data-end="929">ドメイン</p>
</li>
<li data-start="930" data-end="943" data-section-id="1js8g6i">
<p data-start="932" data-end="943">WordPress導入</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="945" data-end="951">有名どころ：</p>
<ul data-start="952" data-end="1031">
<li data-start="952" data-end="991" data-section-id="16uh11">
<p data-start="954" data-end="991"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://www.xserver.ne.jp/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">エックスサーバー<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="992" data-end="1031" data-section-id="btvcid">
<p data-start="994" data-end="1031"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">ConoHa WING<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1033" data-end="1038">メリット：</p>
<ul data-start="1039" data-end="1066">
<li data-start="1039" data-end="1046" data-section-id="1jkut7t">
<p data-start="1041" data-end="1046">自由度高い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1047" data-end="1055" data-section-id="5hxn61">
<p data-start="1049" data-end="1055">SEOに強い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1056" data-end="1066" data-section-id="5ty603">
<p data-start="1058" data-end="1066">長く運営しやすい</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1068" data-end="1074">デメリット：</p>
<ul data-start="1075" data-end="1090">
<li data-start="1075" data-end="1082" data-section-id="1gvhdsu">
<p data-start="1077" data-end="1082">少し難しい</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1083" data-end="1090" data-section-id="1puza93">
<p data-start="1085" data-end="1090">管理が必要</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1092" data-end="1095">
<h1 data-start="1097" data-end="1116" data-section-id="10fgfeb">③ 自分でコードを書く（勉強向け）</h1>
<p data-start="1118" data-end="1137">もし「Web制作を学びたい」ならこれ。</p>
<p data-start="1139" data-end="1144">使うもの：</p>
<ul data-start="1146" data-end="1171">
<li data-start="1146" data-end="1152" data-section-id="1j3sm39">
<p data-start="1148" data-end="1152">HTML</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1153" data-end="1158" data-section-id="1o4e2z">
<p data-start="1155" data-end="1158">CSS</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1159" data-end="1171" data-section-id="1oinkpn">
<p data-start="1161" data-end="1171">JavaScript</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1173" data-end="1182">さらに本格的なら：</p>
<ul data-start="1183" data-end="1200">
<li data-start="1183" data-end="1190" data-section-id="179haax">
<p data-start="1185" data-end="1190">React</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1191" data-end="1200" data-section-id="ekc860">
<p data-start="1193" data-end="1200">Next.js</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1202" data-end="1213">問い合わせフォームは：</p>
<ul data-start="1214" data-end="1253">
<li data-start="1214" data-end="1225" data-section-id="wrwwjz">
<p data-start="1216" data-end="1225">Formspree</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1226" data-end="1242" data-section-id="11ic25k">
<p data-start="1228" data-end="1242">Googleフォーム埋め込み</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1243" data-end="1253" data-section-id="1mi4f8l">
<p data-start="1245" data-end="1253">Firebase</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1255" data-end="1263">などが簡単です。</p>
<hr data-start="1265" data-end="1268">
<h1 data-start="1270" data-end="1286" data-section-id="1l4kuto">初心者なら実際どうするべき？</h1>
<p data-start="1288" data-end="1300">おすすめ順はこんな感じ。</p>
<h2 data-start="1302" data-end="1313" data-section-id="75oof4">「すぐ作りたい」</h2>
<p data-start="1314" data-end="1329">→ Wix or STUDIO</p>
