to [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d74987bc-bda7-4882-ae94-868dab1f7c1d" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="64">コード生成なら、目的によってかなり変わります。<br data-start="23" data-end="26">
「ピアノ教室サイトを作る」という用途なら、今かなり使いやすいのはこの辺です。</p>
<hr data-start="66" data-end="69">
<h1 data-start="71" data-end="79" data-section-id="s8odkt">総合的に強い</h1>
<h2 data-start="81" data-end="121" data-section-id="135sat4"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://chatgpt.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">ChatGPT<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></h2>
<p data-start="122" data-end="130">かなり万能です。</p>
<p data-start="132" data-end="140">特に強いところ：</p>
<ul data-start="141" data-end="226">
<li data-start="141" data-end="166" data-section-id="1hygiav">
<p data-start="143" data-end="166">HTML/CSS/JavaScript全部対応</p>
</li>
<li data-start="167" data-end="192" data-section-id="e12ixe">
<p data-start="169" data-end="192">「こういうサイト作りたい」でまとめて生成できる</p>
</li>
<li data-start="193" data-end="204" data-section-id="1a3p09y">
<p data-start="195" data-end="204">修正依頼がしやすい</p>
</li>
<li data-start="205" data-end="217" data-section-id="muv5dh">
<p data-start="207" data-end="217">デザイン提案もできる</p>
</li>
<li data-start="218" data-end="226" data-section-id="c38znz">
<p data-start="220" data-end="226">日本語が自然</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="228" data-end="232">例えば：</p>
<blockquote data-start="234" data-end="277">
<p data-start="236" data-end="277">「白基調のおしゃれなピアノ教室サイトを作って。問い合わせフォーム付き。スマホ対応」</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="279" data-end="297">みたいに投げるだけでも結構作れます。</p>
<p data-start="299" data-end="313">初心者にはかなり向いてます。</p>
<hr data-start="315" data-end="318">
<h1 data-start="320" data-end="334" data-section-id="1g7aeyk">プログラミング特化で人気</h1>
<h2 data-start="336" data-end="376" data-section-id="1xsvxi0"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://claude.ai/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Claude<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></h2>
<p data-start="377" data-end="392">長いコードや大規模修正が得意。</p>
<p data-start="394" data-end="397">強み：</p>
<ul data-start="398" data-end="439">
<li data-start="398" data-end="408" data-section-id="m3qg7l">
<p data-start="400" data-end="408">コード整理が上手</p>
</li>
<li data-start="409" data-end="423" data-section-id="hoiimh">
<p data-start="411" data-end="423">デザイン系HTMLが綺麗</p>
</li>
<li data-start="424" data-end="439" data-section-id="6yz9a2">
<p data-start="426" data-end="439">長文の仕様書を理解しやすい</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="441" data-end="460">Webサイト生成はかなり評判いいです。</p>
<hr data-start="462" data-end="465">
<h1 data-start="467" data-end="476" data-section-id="10uz7fm">エンジニア寄り</h1>
<h2 data-start="478" data-end="518" data-section-id="2cwq60"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/features/copilot?utm_source=chatgpt.com">GitHub Copilot<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></h2>
<p data-start="519" data-end="535">VSCodeに入れて使うタイプ。</p>
<p data-start="537" data-end="540">特徴：</p>
<ul data-start="541" data-end="574">
<li data-start="541" data-end="552" data-section-id="4oaesk">
<p data-start="543" data-end="552">コード補完が超強い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="553" data-end="562" data-section-id="1xqirvb">
<p data-start="555" data-end="562">開発効率が高い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="563" data-end="574" data-section-id="i5gz50">
<p data-start="565" data-end="574">実務エンジニア向け</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="576" data-end="592">ただし初心者には少し難しいです。</p>
<hr data-start="594" data-end="597">
<h1 data-start="599" data-end="608" data-section-id="1jjed4f">最近かなり強い</h1>
<h2 data-start="610" data-end="650" data-section-id="x00cns"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://gemini.google.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Gemini<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></h2>
<p data-start="651" data-end="659">Google製。</p>
<p data-start="661" data-end="664">強み：</p>
<ul data-start="665" data-end="700">
<li data-start="665" data-end="673" data-section-id="82qskj">
<p data-start="667" data-end="673">無料でも強め</p>
</li>
<li data-start="674" data-end="686" data-section-id="1noyvqn">
<p data-start="676" data-end="686">コード生成速度が速い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="687" data-end="700" data-section-id="9lahto">
<p data-start="689" data-end="700">Web系も普通に書ける</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="702" data-end="705">
<h1 data-start="707" data-end="720" data-section-id="8i35kb">実際おすすめの使い分け</h1>
<h2 data-start="722" data-end="730" data-section-id="25787u">完全初心者</h2>
<p data-start="731" data-end="740">→ ChatGPT</p>
<h2 data-start="742" data-end="751" data-section-id="1vx8qs8">デザイン重視</h2>
<p data-start="752" data-end="760">→ Claude</p>
<h2 data-start="762" data-end="769" data-section-id="cvu1r8">本格開発</h2>
<p data-start="770" data-end="789">→ Copilot + ChatGPT</p>
<hr data-start="791" data-end="794">
<h1 data-start="796" data-end="807" data-section-id="1ceijgz">かなり便利な使い方</h1>
<p data-start="809" data-end="824">AIにこう依頼すると強いです。</p>
<hr data-start="826" data-end="829">
<h2 data-start="831" data-end="837" data-section-id="1i7sezk">悪い例</h2>
<blockquote data-start="838" data-end="849">
<p data-start="840" data-end="849">ピアノサイト作って</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="851" data-end="854">
<h2 data-start="856" data-end="862" data-section-id="1h6n17p">良い例</h2>
<blockquote data-start="863" data-end="997">
<p data-start="865" data-end="997">ピアノ教室のWebサイトを作ってください。<br data-start="886" data-end="889">
白とベージュ基調。<br data-start="900" data-end="903">
トップページ、講師紹介、料金表、問い合わせフォームを作成。<br data-start="934" data-end="937">
スマホ対応。<br data-start="945" data-end="948">
HTML/CSS/JavaScriptで。<br data-start="971" data-end="974">
初心者でも編集しやすい構造にしてください。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="999" data-end="1002">
<h1 data-start="1004" data-end="1019" data-section-id="ihxcts">今のAIでどこまでできる？</h1>
<p data-start="1021" data-end="1034">現在はかなり進化していて、</p>
<ul data-start="1036" data-end="1080">
<li data-start="1036" data-end="1042" data-section-id="1bivd0u">
<p data-start="1038" data-end="1042">デザイン</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1043" data-end="1053" data-section-id="ryy5g0">
<p data-start="1045" data-end="1053">レスポンシブ対応</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1054" data-end="1063" data-section-id="1nnkfi7">
<p data-start="1056" data-end="1063">アニメーション</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1064" data-end="1070" data-section-id="1bj67mw">
<p data-start="1066" data-end="1070">フォーム</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1071" data-end="1080" data-section-id="10cvd3k">
<p data-start="1073" data-end="1080">SEO基本設定</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1082" data-end="1097">この辺まで普通に生成できます。</p>
<p data-start="1099" data-end="1103">ただし、</p>
<ul data-start="1104" data-end="1137">
<li data-start="1104" data-end="1112" data-section-id="1si23pm">
<p data-start="1106" data-end="1112">サーバー公開</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1113" data-end="1121" data-section-id="fndx0g">
<p data-start="1115" data-end="1121">ドメイン設定</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1122" data-end="1130" data-section-id="1vif4d0">
<p data-start="1124" data-end="1130">セキュリティ</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1131" data-end="1137" data-section-id="1no0svh">
<p data-start="1133" data-end="1137">本番運用</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1139" data-end="1152">は人間側の確認も必要です。</p>
<hr data-start="1154" data-end="1157">
<h1 data-start="1159" data-end="1171" data-section-id="w6vczs">個人的におすすめ構成</h1>
<p data-start="1173" data-end="1189">初心者ならかなりこれが強いです。</p>
<ol data-start="1191" data-end="1280">
<li data-start="1191" data-end="1207" data-section-id="1d5vow9">
<p data-start="1194" data-end="1207">ChatGPTでコード生成</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1208" data-end="1220" data-section-id="16g7hfc">
<p data-start="1211" data-end="1220">VSCodeで編集</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1221" data-end="1233" data-section-id="1c9zo1f">
<p data-start="1224" data-end="1233">GitHubに保存</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1234" data-end="1280" data-section-id="ytmbzu">
<p data-start="1237" data-end="1280"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://vercel.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Vercel<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span> で無料公開</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1282" data-end="1301">これでかなり本格的なサイトが作れます。</p>
<hr data-start="1303" data-end="1306">
<p data-start="1308" data-end="1315">必要なら次に、</p>
