<ul data-start="14" data-end="101">
<li data-start="14" data-end="39" data-section-id="8b1zes">
<p data-start="16" data-end="39"><strong data-start="16" data-end="26">VSCode</strong> → 「コードを書く場所」</p>
</li>
<li data-start="40" data-end="70" data-section-id="10zdq5x">
<p data-start="42" data-end="70"><strong data-start="42" data-end="52">GitHub</strong> → 「コードを保存・管理する場所」</p>
</li>
<li data-start="71" data-end="101" data-section-id="18zfki2">
<p data-start="73" data-end="101"><strong data-start="73" data-end="83">Vercel</strong> → 「Webサイトを公開する場所」</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="103" data-end="111">という役割です。</p>
<p data-start="113" data-end="131">流れで見るとかなり分かりやすいです。</p>
<hr data-start="133" data-end="136">
<h1 data-start="138" data-end="145" data-section-id="v7ztku">全体の流れ</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="147" data-end="258"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>ChatGPTでコード生成</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>VSCodeで編集</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>GitHubにアップロード</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Vercelで公開</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>インターネットで見れる</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="260" data-end="263">
<h1 data-start="265" data-end="278" data-section-id="myla1i">① VSCodeとは？</h1>
<h2 data-start="280" data-end="320" data-section-id="135sat4"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Visual Studio Code</span></span></h2>
<p data-start="324" data-end="347">Microsoft製の無料コードエディタです。</p>
<p data-start="349" data-end="390">公式：<br>
<span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://code.visualstudio.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Visual Studio Code<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="392" data-end="395">
<h2 data-start="397" data-end="402" data-section-id="1mwm6m">役割</h2>
<p data-start="404" data-end="408">ここで：</p>
<ul data-start="410" data-end="461">
<li data-start="410" data-end="419" data-section-id="1gbn040">
<p data-start="412" data-end="419">HTMLを書く</p>
</li>
<li data-start="420" data-end="428" data-section-id="1ul7k3y">
<p data-start="422" data-end="428">CSSを書く</p>
</li>
<li data-start="429" data-end="444" data-section-id="i0h4v2">
<p data-start="431" data-end="444">JavaScriptを書く</p>
</li>
<li data-start="445" data-end="461" data-section-id="1vltns7">
<p data-start="447" data-end="461">AIが作ったコードを修正する</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="463" data-end="474">つまり「作業机」です。</p>
<hr data-start="476" data-end="479">
<h2 data-start="481" data-end="489" data-section-id="19j4li7">できること</h2>
<p data-start="491" data-end="495">例えば：</p>
