<p data-start="1518" data-end="1522">すると：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1524" data-end="1554"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>mypiano.vercel.app</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1556" data-end="1570">みたいなURLがもらえます。</p>
<hr data-start="1572" data-end="1575">
<h1 data-start="1577" data-end="1592" data-section-id="1wn0c7o">3つの関係を超簡単に言うと</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1594" data-end="1665" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1594" data-end="1607"><tr data-start="1594" data-end="1607"><th data-start="1594" data-end="1601" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">サービス</th><th data-start="1601" data-end="1607" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">役割</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1618" data-end="1665"><tr data-start="1618" data-end="1633"><td data-start="1618" data-end="1627" data-col-size="sm">VSCode</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1627" data-end="1633">作る</td></tr><tr data-start="1634" data-end="1649"><td data-start="1634" data-end="1643" data-col-size="sm">GitHub</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1643" data-end="1649">保存</td></tr><tr data-start="1650" data-end="1665"><td data-start="1650" data-end="1659" data-col-size="sm">Vercel</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1659" data-end="1665">公開</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="表をコピーする" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1667" data-end="1670">
<h1 data-start="1672" data-end="1685" data-section-id="1q8hklg">初心者におすすめの理由</h1>
<p data-start="1687" data-end="1693">この構成は：</p>
<ul data-start="1695" data-end="1748">
<li data-start="1695" data-end="1705" data-section-id="9vmeck">
<p data-start="1697" data-end="1705">無料で始めやすい</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1706" data-end="1713" data-section-id="5w02p5">
<p data-start="1708" data-end="1713">プロも使う</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1714" data-end="1725" data-section-id="1g6qsn2">
<p data-start="1716" data-end="1725">AIとの相性が良い</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1726" data-end="1748" data-section-id="1mm05m2">
<p data-start="1728" data-end="1748">将来React/Next.jsにも行ける</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1750" data-end="1760">のでかなり強いです。</p>
<hr data-start="1762" data-end="1765">
<h1 data-start="1767" data-end="1779" data-section-id="jq7i9v">実は今かなりAI向き</h1>
<p data-start="1781" data-end="1785">最近は：</p>
<ul data-start="1787" data-end="1838">
<li data-start="1787" data-end="1802" data-section-id="dhd7gb">
<p data-start="1789" data-end="1802">ChatGPTでコード生成</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1803" data-end="1816" data-section-id="7pmhm4">
<p data-start="1805" data-end="1816">VSCodeで少し修正</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1817" data-end="1827" data-section-id="1fnws5k">
<p data-start="1819" data-end="1827">GitHub保存</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1828" data-end="1838" data-section-id="zmnric">
<p data-start="1830" data-end="1838">Vercel公開</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1840" data-end="1862">この流れで個人サイト作る人かなり増えてます。</p>
<p data-start="1864" data-end="1891">ピアノ教室サイトくらいなら、初心者でも十分現実的です。</p>
<hr data-start="1893" data-end="1896">
<p data-start="1898" data-end="1905">必要なら次に、</p>
<ul data-start="1907" data-end="2168">
<li data-start="1907" data-end="1948" data-section-id="1tocfdg">
<p data-start="1909" data-end="1948">「<span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent group inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-nowrap" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden align-middle" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 1; width: 1.5rem;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="group-hover:entity-accent icon text-token-text-primary inline-block transition-transform duration-150 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#e04414" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="group-hover:entity-accent whitespace-normal">VSCodeインストール方法</span></span>」</p>
