<hr data-start="507" data-end="510">
<h1 data-start="512" data-end="529" data-section-id="1bu0nq2">② GitHubアカウント作成</h1>
<h2 data-start="531" data-end="536" data-section-id="1mwpty">公式</h2>
<p data-start="538" data-end="575"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">GitHub<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="577" data-end="580">
<h2 data-start="582" data-end="589" data-section-id="1gve29">やること</h2>
<ul data-start="591" data-end="618">
<li data-start="591" data-end="598" data-section-id="4nauuv">
<p data-start="593" data-end="598">メール登録</p>
</li>
<li data-start="599" data-end="608" data-section-id="1ublqex">
<p data-start="601" data-end="608">ユーザー名作成</p>
</li>
