<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1939" data-end="2012"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Bash</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ10">git</span><span> remote add origin URL</span><br><span class="ͼ10">git</span><span> push </span><span class="ͼ12">-u</span><span> origin main</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2014" data-end="2017">
<h1 data-start="2019" data-end="2032" data-section-id="swnslj">⑪ Vercelで公開</h1>
<p data-start="2034" data-end="2089">Vercelへログイン<br data-start="2045" data-end="2048">
↓<br data-start="2049" data-end="2052">
「Add New Project」<br data-start="2069" data-end="2072">
↓<br data-start="2073" data-end="2076">
GitHubリポジトリ選択</p>
<p data-start="2091" data-end="2098">すると自動で：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2100" data-end="2126"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>公開</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2128" data-end="2133">されます。</p>
<hr data-start="2135" data-end="2138">
<h1 data-start="2140" data-end="2147" data-section-id="14ayqe8">完成すると</h1>
<p data-start="2149" data-end="2153">例えば：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2155" data-end="2207"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>piano-school-site.vercel.app</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2209" data-end="2222">みたいなURLになります。</p>
<p data-start="2224" data-end="2234">スマホでも見れます。</p>
<hr data-start="2236" data-end="2239">
<h1 data-start="2241" data-end="2247" data-section-id="1tgk55z">修正方法</h1>
<p data-start="2249" data-end="2253">今後は：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2255" data-end="2315"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>VSCodeで編集</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>GitHubへpush</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Vercel自動更新</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2317" data-end="2320">だけ。</p>
<p data-start="2322" data-end="2329">かなり楽です。</p>
<hr data-start="2331" data-end="2334">
<h1 data-start="2336" data-end="2347" data-section-id="svic5y">初心者向けおすすめ</h1>
<p data-start="2349" data-end="2353">最初は：</p>
<ul data-start="2355" data-end="2367">
<li data-start="2355" data-end="2361" data-section-id="1j3sm39">
<p data-start="2357" data-end="2361">HTML</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2362" data-end="2367" data-section-id="1o4e2z">
<p data-start="2364" data-end="2367">CSS</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2369" data-end="2377">だけで十分です。</p>
<p data-start="2379" data-end="2398">JavaScriptは後からでもOK。</p>
<hr data-start="2400" data-end="2403">
<h1 data-start="2405" data-end="2417" data-section-id="1e5ivlx">ここまでできると強い</h1>
<p data-start="2419" data-end="2428">この流れ覚えると：</p>
<ul data-start="2430" data-end="2473">
<li data-start="2430" data-end="2439" data-section-id="1lk5v31">
<p data-start="2432" data-end="2439">ポートフォリオ</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2440" data-end="2445" data-section-id="1fuqv7">
<p data-start="2442" data-end="2445">ブログ</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2446" data-end="2453" data-section-id="1kwqaq9">
<p data-start="2448" data-end="2453">店舗サイト</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2454" data-end="2463" data-section-id="1sus1ng">
<p data-start="2456" data-end="2463">サークルサイト</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2464" data-end="2473" data-section-id="ogw5zs">
<p data-start="2466" data-end="2473">自己紹介サイト</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2475" data-end="2488">全部作れるようになります。</p>
<hr data-start="2490" data-end="2493">
<p data-start="2495" data-end="2502">次に必要なら、</p>
