今のフォームは、</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="40" data-end="76"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>送信したように見えるだけ</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="78" data-end="82">だけど、</p>
<p data-start="84" data-end="92">これからやると：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="94" data-end="137"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>実際にあなたのメールへ問い合わせが届く</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="139" data-end="147">ようになります。</p>
<p data-start="149" data-end="162">初心者なら一番おすすめは：</p>
<h1 data-start="164" data-end="175" data-section-id="tpqbi9">Formspree</h1>
<p data-start="177" data-end="180">です。</p>
<p data-start="182" data-end="185">理由：</p>
<ul data-start="186" data-end="231">
<li data-start="186" data-end="196" data-section-id="9vmeck">
<p data-start="188" data-end="196">無料で始めやすい</p>
</li>
<li data-start="197" data-end="205" data-section-id="1si1wsh">
<p data-start="199" data-end="205">サーバー不要</p>
</li>
<li data-start="206" data-end="217" data-section-id="c6d0zd">
<p data-start="208" data-end="217">HTMLだけで動く</p>
</li>
<li data-start="218" data-end="231" data-section-id="126x133">
<p data-start="220" data-end="231">Vercelと相性良い</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="233" data-end="236">
<h1 data-start="238" data-end="246" data-section-id="1fe29ob">完成イメージ</h1>
<p data-start="248" data-end="254">ユーザーが：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="256" data-end="294"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>名前</span><br><span>メール</span><br><span>問い合わせ内容</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="296" data-end="299">入力。</p>
<p data-start="301" data-end="302">↓</p>
<p data-start="304" data-end="307">送信。</p>
<p data-start="309" data-end="310">↓</p>
<p data-start="312" data-end="325">あなたのGmailへ届く。</p>
<hr data-start="327" data-end="330">
<h1 data-start="332" data-end="352" data-section-id="7u6cgb">STEP 1 Formspree登録</h1>
<p data-start="354" data-end="357">開く。</p>
<p data-start="359" data-end="396"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://formspree.io/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Formspree<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
<hr data-start="398" data-end="401">
<h1 data-start="403" data-end="412" data-section-id="2ooivk">Sign Up</h1>
<p data-start="414" data-end="430">GoogleアカウントでもOK。</p>
<hr data-start="432" data-end="435">
<h1 data-start="437" data-end="454" data-section-id="p1a84s">STEP 2 New Form</h1>
<p data-start="456" data-end="462">ログイン後：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="464" data-end="496"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>New Form</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="498" data-end="501">押す。</p>
<hr data-start="503" data-end="506">
<h1 data-start="508" data-end="514" data-section-id="1pgynyw">名前入力</h1>
<p data-start="516" data-end="520">例えば：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="522" data-end="559"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="コピーする" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Piano Contact</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="561" data-end="564">
<h1 data-start="566" data-end="579" data-section-id="1aoef9w">Create Form</h1>
<p data-start="581" data-end="584">押す。</p>
<hr data-start="586" data-end="589">
<h1 data-start="591" data-end="609" data-section-id="maptni">STEP 3 メールアドレス認証</h1>
<p data-start="611" data-end="628">問い合わせを受けたいメールを認証。</p>
<p data-start="630" data-end="634">例えば：</p>
<ul data-start="635" data-end="652">
<li data-start="635" data-end="642" data-section-id="16zvg6e">
<p data-start="637" data-end="642">Gmail</p>
</li>
<li data-start="643" data-end="652" data-section-id="bdmjl">
<p data-start="645" data-end="652">Outlook</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="654" data-end="657">など。</p>
<hr data-start="659" data-end="662">
<h1 data-start="664" data-end="688" data-section-id="1ls7n90">STEP 4 Form Endpoint取得</h1>
