<h1 data-section-id="ynlb4r" data-start="7714" data-end="7726">この状態でできること</h1>
<ul data-start="7728" data-end="7794">
<li data-section-id="8ion06" data-start="7728" data-end="7735">
<p data-start="7730" data-end="7735">スマホ対応</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="177od0z" data-start="7736" data-end="7743">
